title: Remove deprecated EnsureOneOf type alias
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    # Description

    Removes deprecated `frame_support::EnsureOneOf` as part of #11561.

    `EnsureOneOf` was an alias for `EitherOfDiverse` (deprecated in favor of `EitherOfDiverse`). It has no remaining usage in this repository.

    Does not close #11561.

    ## Integration

    ```diff
    - use frame_support::traits::EnsureOneOf;
    + use frame_support::traits::EitherOfDiverse;
    ```

    - 2 files: substrate/frame/support/src/traits/dispatch.rs, traits.rs
    - Verified no in-repo references before removal
crates:
- name: frame-support
  bump: major
